  questDescription: My house eats a fortune in firewood every winter, I want it super-duper
    efficient! The walls creak quite a bit too, so make them reasonably sturdy. And
    keep the wolves out somehow, I don't care how.
  requirements:
  - type: 4
    tier: 3
  - type: 1
    tier: 2
  - type: 6
    tier: 0
  successText: Warm, solid and wolf-proof! I'm throwing a party!
  partialText: Well, the draft is gone. Mostly. Okay.
  failureText: Now the roof leaks and the firewood bill doubled. Terrific.
